  "docs": {
    "description": "Primary action + adjacent dropdown of related secondary actions. 24 variants: prio (primary, secondary) × size (sm 32px, md 40px) × state (default, hover, pressed, focus, loading, disabled). Drawn heights are the visible control; the 44×44px WCAG hit area is padded in code (no target-size variable exists yet). Use when one action is clearly dominant but the user may sometimes need a variant (Save / Save as draft / Save and close). For 3+ equal actions use a Button Group; for a pure menu trigger use Dropdown.",
